      "value": "As noted, this is an intended feature, not a bug. (Also as noted but bears repeating, I've always wanted to say that.)\n\nI've updated our Index Controller documentation with more verbose descriptions of Gesture Toggle.\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/valve-index#section-gesture-toggle",
