  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Using Index Controllers it's possible to get gestures stuck when changing between the 'gestures mode' and the no gestures mode using the thumb stick.\n\nTo reproduce:\n1. Enable the mode for performing gestures.\n2. Perform a gesture.\n3. Whilst holding the gesture, disable the gesture mode with the thumb stick press.\n4. Gesture will be stuck playing regardless of hand movement.",
